{"id":"nff8b972991","headline":"[Editorial] International Oil Prices Soar, But Petroleum Prices Frozen for Six Months","summary":"The government will decide the maximum petroleum price to apply from the 19th, and a freeze is highly likely again. International oil prices have soared while domestic prices remain frozen.","why":"Brent crude is the global benchmark for oil prices, and Korea imports most of its crude, so global prices feed into its fuel costs.","category":"commodities","event_type":"commodity-prices","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Seoul","country":"South Korea","lat":37.566,"lon":126.978,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"국민일보","url":"https://www.kmib.co.kr/article/view.asp?arcid=9000013195&code=11171111&sid1=opi"},"sources":[{"name":"국민일보","url":"https://www.kmib.co.kr/article/view.asp?arcid=9000013195&code=11171111&sid1=opi"}],"published_at":"2026-09-17T16:21:02Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-13T13:37:32Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"ed7df1f94b6f0daf","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-13T13:37:32Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-09-17T16:21:02Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-09-18T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"JA","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"[사설] 국제유가 폭등하는데, 6개월째 묶은 석유가격","source_language":"kor","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/oil-refinery-6999396.jpg","alt":"oil refinery (illustration)","credit":"tasukaran","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/city-cityscape-night-evening-6999396/"}}